  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Namibia&apos;s sustainable growth &amp; socio-economic development to alleviate poverty &amp; improve livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme is aimed at supporting Namibia to address areas of key socio-economic challenge to positively impact and improve life in Namibia. To support Post&#x2019;s goals to promote freedom &amp; democracy; build defence &amp; security partnerships to protect UK interests &amp; values; strengthen the bilateral relationship with Namibia; support Namibia to deliver a cleaner, greener planet through climate action, adaption &amp; mitigation activities and environmental conservation; and empowering women &amp; girls in key socio-economic areas on gender-based violence, education, &amp; economic empowerment (enterprise development).</narrative>
  </description>
